                "description": "Global TH1100-ED Narrow Stile Crash Bar Exit Device. These Narrow Stile Crash Bar Exit Device for metal doors up to 42 inches wide. Modern styling and available in  Aluminum or Duronotic (Dark Bronze) finish.",
